Culoum Honor-Sworn was one of [[Divinity/Hierophant|Aurelia I]]'s first companions, sworn to the [[Judge of Ages|Judge]]. When the holy war against the warlords of [[Geography/Calaria/index|Calaria]] was over and the companions went their separate ways, he took up residence in the Opaline Mountains with a contingent of knights and mages, and they became the first council of [[Org/The Scale/index|the Scale]].

A statue of him stands in the shrine in the lower hull of the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]], dressed in the old armor of the Scale and set among the likenesses of Aurelia's other companions. [[People/Argyle|Argyle]] sees something of his own grandmother in the carved face.
